    <briefdescription>
<para>Hash-based provenance ledger for <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package" kindref="compound">LoRAPackage</ref> and <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_adapter_product" kindref="compound">AdapterProduct</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_provenance_hash_ledger" kindref="compound">ProvenanceHashLedger</ref> is the central authority for all Phase-4 provenance artefacts. It:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Maintains the hash-chained version history of every <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package" kindref="compound">LoRAPackage</ref> and <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_adapter_product" kindref="compound">AdapterProduct</ref> registered with it.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Builds and stores ReceiptChains (one per artifact) from appended DistributionReceipts.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Creates and validates ReceiptManifests for batch distribution events.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Maintains a per-artifact ShardLedger whose entries are chained by prev_entry_hash for RAID-Merkle-Proof integration.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Exports full audit paths as JSON for CLI / REST consumption.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread safety: all public methods are protected by a single shared mutex. Reads and writes from multiple threads are safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
